{"item_id": "BM0170", "position": 170, "batch": "2026-11-25_kc-c2_09", "anon_id": "M-09-012", "kind": "solve-compute", "role": "C2", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "status": "computed", "r_code": "S <- matrix(c(4, 1.2, 1.2, 9), 2)\nvalue <- sqrt(diag(S))\nanswer <- if (isTRUE(all.equal(value[2], 3)) && isTRUE(all.equal(value[1], 2)) && value[2] > value[1]) \"D\" else NA", "answer_expression": "", "test_inputs": [], "correct_options": ["D"], "note": "The standard deviations are the square roots of the variances, which gives 2 and 3."}
