{"item_id": "BM0175", "position": 175, "batch": "2026-11-25_kc-c2_09", "anon_id": "M-09-017", "kind": "solve-compute", "role": "C2", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "status": "computed", "r_code": "sigma <- 1.75; n <- 42\nanswer <- sigma^2 / (2 * n)", "answer_expression": "", "test_inputs": [], "correct_options": [], "note": "Fisher information for sigma with known mean is 2n/sigma^2, so the asymptotic variance is sigma^2/(2n)."}
